                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>  ِسوره الاسرى مايه واحدى عسره انه مكيه \ بسمِ اللَهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيْمِ سُبْحَانَ الذِّيْ أسْرَي بِعَبُدِهِ <note>In the word الذي , šadda is place above ḏāl. The word بعبده is vocalized bi-ʻabudihi instead of bi-ʻabdihi.</note>
                     </incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#15r">-15r</locus>لَقَدْ جِئْتَ شَيْاً نُكْرًا<note>Deletion of an alif placed between the two last words</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>17:1-18:74. Verse markers are red dots or marks in the shape of letter hā'. Numerous words completed on the following line. Deletions in black or red ink.</note>
                     <note/>
